FROM runpod/comfyui@sha256:2cb4015beb6e16b0bbc05ed5d1e39288545b7f4ce8fed9534f4ef0fa88aa2e4d
SHELL ["/bin/bash", "-lc"]

# Needed for git checkout
RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends git \
 && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*

# Pin to a specific ComfyUI tag (recommended)
ARG COMFYUI_TAG=v0.42.5
RUN cd /opt/comfyui-baked \
 && git fetch --tags --force \
 && git checkout "${COMFYUI_TAG}"

# Install the matching python deps for this ComfyUI version
# (frontend package, workflow templates, embedded docs, comfy-aimdo, etc.)
RUN python3 -m pip install --no-cache-dir -U pip \
 && python3 -m pip install --no-cache-dir -r /opt/comfyui-baked/requirements.txt

# --- Alternative: always latest (uncomment if you prefer, not reproducible) ---
# RUN cd /opt/comfyui-baked \
#  && git fetch origin --prune \
#  && git checkout master \
#  && git pull --ff-only \
#  && python3 -m pip install --no-cache-dir -U pip \
#  && python3 -m pip install --no-cache-dir -r /opt/comfyui-baked/requirements.txt
